OL,3,GNEWSATwo pilots eject and parachute out
OL,4,Aof RAF plane before crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pilots ejected and parachuted out
OL,7,Fof their plane before the RAF training
OL,8,Faircraft crashed.
OL,10,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots of
OL,11,Fthe RAF T2 Hawk aircraft were being
OL,12,Ftreated for minor injuries following
OL,13,Fthe incident in the Pencarnisiog area
OL,14,Fof Anglesey.
OL,16,FThe force said helicopters from the
OL,17,FCoastguard and the Wales Air Ambulance
OL,18,Fwere sent to the scene close to RAF
OL,19,FValley on the island. The pilots have
OL,20,Fbeen taken to Birmingham for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
